          "title": "Read this route"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": []
    },
    {
      "id": "743AE0720D8DE899",
      "title": "Arcane Discovery",
      "x": -4,
      "y": 10,
      "icon": "minecraft:map",
      "optional": true,
      "description": [
        "Try a spellbook or a living-mana garden. These routes open utility spells, magical processing and trade with engineers.",
        "This row suggests a direction, not a requirement to finish every mod. Linked icons open the original quests and share their progress and rewards. Use /journey for a current recommendation."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "79B66351A2C8AA96",
