          "title": "Read this route"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": []
    },
    {
      "id": "78F3DB4C54D24138",
      "title": "Into the Unknown",
      "x": -4,
      "y": 15,
      "icon": "minecraft:map",
      "optional": true,
      "description": [
        "Prepare food, protection and a way home. Dimensional discoveries supply repeatable Trials and rare reagents; you can explore while friends build.",
        "This row suggests a direction, not a requirement to finish every mod. Linked icons open the original quests and share their progress and rewards. Use /journey for a current recommendation."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5DACE49E4C6E498C",
