      "title": "Ancient Powers",
      "x": -4,
      "y": 30,
      "icon": "minecraft:map",
      "optional": true,
      "description": [
        "Pick a hunt or master a renewable resource route. Boss progression supplies magic and industry, while advanced farming remains a valuable specialty.",
        "This row suggests a direction, not a requirement to finish every mod. Linked icons open the original quests and share their progress and rewards. Use /journey for a current recommendation."
      ],
