      "x": -4,
      "y": 35,
      "icon": "minecraft:map",
      "optional": true,
      "description": [
        "Trade discoveries across the six disciplines. Material tiers and the four legacy sigils lead to the Core, a Matrix and your endgame arsenal.",
        "This row suggests a direction, not a requirement to finish every mod. Linked icons open the original quests and share their progress and rewards. Use /journey for a current recommendation."
